  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A radioactive nucleus at rest having&nbsp;mass number <math> <mi>A</mi> </math>, emits an alpha-particle with&nbsp;speed&nbsp;<math><mi>v</mi></math>. The recoil speed of the daughter&nbsp;nucleus is</p>\r",
